s  we have to stress how important this is  when we look at the south korea data  south korea is the most analogous system  to us in terms of medical care and they  have an excellent infrastructure  the death rate in people over 80 years  old was over eight percent  70 to 80 the death rate was five and a  half percent  um 60 to 70 the death rate was three and  a half percent under 60 the death rate  was about 0.1 percent  so the key is if you are older six over  60. no matter how healthy you think you  are  no matter how much you can run and jog  and do whatever  you were still at dramatically high risk  for complication and even death from  this virus  so you have to listen to these  guidelines please please please  the reason our country is going through  these aggressive measures  is to protect the people over 60. yeah  they have to play along and i really  hope they do  and the people who are not over 60  needed to remember that what they do can  have an effect on those people in that  more vulnerable category  dr david agus thank you very much
 

